(4262524, 615218, 54778, '<td valign="top">The composition is slightly lacking.. everything seems backed up into the corner with unrequired negative space in the forefront.. Better positioning and lighting would have helped.. and maybe not using a distracting back colour would be better..</td>', 'The composition is slightly lacking.. everything seems backed up into the corner with unrequired negative space in the forefront.. Better positioning and lighting would have helped.. and maybe not using a distracting back colour would be better..', '2007-11-21 10:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
