(4262568, 615016, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent -Well composed, excellent lighting, love the cartoon book, and the face it perfect.<br/> <br/>I especially like the use of Zumdahl''s Chemistry book.  He is a cool guy - one of those guys that meets you once in a class of 1000 students and will forever know your name.</td>', 'Excellent -Well composed, excellent lighting, love the cartoon book, and the face it perfect. I especially like the use of Zumdahl''s Chemistry book.  He is a cool guy - one of those guys that meets you once in a class of 1000 students and will forever know your name.', '2007-11-21 10:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
