(4266335, 615030, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but the hand holding the magnifying glass isn''t too spiffy looking. Maybe more DOF and somewhat different lighting and crop out more of the hand.</td>', 'Good concept, but the hand holding the magnifying glass isn''t too spiffy looking. Maybe more DOF and somewhat different lighting and crop out more of the hand.', '2007-11-23 21:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266336, 615191, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Would like a little more lighting on his face near his hand.</td>', 'Nicely composed. Would like a little more lighting on his face near his hand.', '2007-11-23 21:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266337, 615186, 62249, '<td valign="top">Funny &amp; works well in B/W.</td>', 'Funny & works well in B/W.', '2007-11-23 21:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266339, 615159, 62249, '<td valign="top">Work on white balance. Skin is too orange. A bit more lighting on her face would help change this from a snapshot to a portrait.</td>', 'Work on white balance. Skin is too orange. A bit more lighting on her face would help change this from a snapshot to a portrait.', '2007-11-23 22:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266341, 615171, 27373, '<td valign="top">Okay, this is nitpicky, but.... The books behind him "..of knitting patterns"  "Needlepoint" just don''t say medical.  Another nit picky point- and I may be wrong on this- I don''t think students get to wear the white coat.  I didn''t mark you down for either picky point.  The lighting is good, you avoided a glare from the glasses, the coat is not blown out.</td>', 'Okay, this is nitpicky, but.... The books behind him "..of knitting patterns"  "Needlepoint" just don''t say medical.  Another nit picky point- and I may be wrong on this- I don''t think students get to wear the white coat.  I didn''t mark you down for either picky point.  The lighting is good, you avoided a glare from the glasses, the coat is not blown out.', '2007-11-23 22:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266343, 614859, 27373, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.</td>', 'Very, very nice.', '2007-11-23 22:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266344, 614164, 62249, '<td valign="top">Needs more interesting lighting.</td>', 'Needs more interesting lighting.', '2007-11-23 22:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266348, 615273, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition that tells the story well. Shot is too pixelated, though. Did you enlarge from a low-res image? Too much sharpening around edges. Would like to see this reshot at higher resolution.</td>', 'Very nice composition that tells the story well. Shot is too pixelated, though. Did you enlarge from a low-res image? Too much sharpening around edges. Would like to see this reshot at higher resolution.', '2007-11-23 22:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266349, 614037, 62249, '<td valign="top">To make this interesting, you''d need to have some lighting on her face and have her in sharper focus.</td>', 'To make this interesting, you''d need to have some lighting on her face and have her in sharper focus.', '2007-11-23 22:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266350, 615177, 27373, '<td valign="top">This is great.  Well thought out, well executed.  I wish there wasn''t quite so much glare on the back cover.</td>', 'This is great.  Well thought out, well executed.  I wish there wasn''t quite so much glare on the back cover.', '2007-11-23 22:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266354, 615273, 27373, '<td valign="top">Would be better in focus.</td>', 'Would be better in focus.', '2007-11-23 22:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266355, 615103, 62249, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more shadow detail in upper left. Composition is good.</td>', 'Would like to see more shadow detail in upper left. Composition is good.', '2007-11-23 22:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4266358, 614580, 62249, '<td valign="top">This would be an interesting shot in the right challenge, but it seems a stretch for book smarts. Composition is good. Needs sharper focus. Keyboard is too blurred.</td>', 'This would be an interesting shot in the right challenge, but it seems a stretch for book smarts. Composition is good. Needs sharper focus. Keyboard is too blurred.', '2007-11-23 22:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
