(4267917, 615177, 3746, '<td valign="top">sexy, sassy and clever, the richness of the reds is great and one can feel the texture of the sheets. my choice for a ribbon.</td>', 'sexy, sassy and clever, the richness of the reds is great and one can feel the texture of the sheets. my choice for a ribbon.', '2007-11-25 09:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267919, 615105, 3746, '<td valign="top">very clever idea and well executed. any shot that makes you study it and think "how did they do that" will do well.. top 5 image at least.. well done.</td>', 'very clever idea and well executed. any shot that makes you study it and think "how did they do that" will do well.. top 5 image at least.. well done.', '2007-11-25 09:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267921, 615044, 3746, '<td valign="top">colour seems a bit washed out, almost gives it the feel ofa 70s indie flick.. good idea though. 7</td>', 'colour seems a bit washed out, almost gives it the feel ofa 70s indie flick.. good idea though. 7', '2007-11-25 09:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267924, 615110, 3746, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and interesting subject matter.. Good use of negative space on the right-hand side, something people don''t understand very well these days. 7</td>', 'Nice angle and interesting subject matter.. Good use of negative space on the right-hand side, something people don''t understand very well these days. 7', '2007-11-25 10:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267926, 615186, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, bumping this from a 7 to an 8, would of like to see a better BW conversion, but its a good idea &amp; where the hell did you find a dumpster full of books like that?</td>', 'OK, bumping this from a 7 to an 8, would of like to see a better BW conversion, but its a good idea & where the hell did you find a dumpster full of books like that?', '2007-11-25 10:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267928, 615148, 3746, '<td valign="top">The title works on two levels here. 6</td>', 'The title works on two levels here. 6', '2007-11-25 10:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267933, 615016, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot. Conceived, set up, and executed well. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cute shot. Conceived, set up, and executed well. Nice job.', '2007-11-25 10:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267953, 615105, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice in an abstract sort of way, but this doesn''t show book smarts in the sense of someone displaying skills/knoweldge acquired through reading.</td>', 'Nice in an abstract sort of way, but this doesn''t show book smarts in the sense of someone displaying skills/knoweldge acquired through reading.', '2007-11-25 10:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267956, 614153, 61818, '<td valign="top">Conceptually I can buy this as it at least shows someone adding to their knowledge or ''book smarts'' by reading a book.  Technically this picture needs to be thrown a life preserver.  First you can barely make out that there is a book in this shot.  The white is so bright as to be almost overexposed and the object itself gets so little space in the frame as to be incidental to the photo.  I  like the expression on the face, those super arched eyebrows are a keeper, but the focus here is very poor.  I can''t see anything in focus at all.  Lighting is rough across the board with some nasty highlights around the eyes near the nose.  Glasses were a good choice (if a choice) and are of a nice book-wormish quality.</td>', 'Conceptually I can buy this as it at least shows someone adding to their knowledge or ''book smarts'' by reading a book.  Technically this picture needs to be thrown a life preserver.  First you can barely make out that there is a book in this shot.  The white is so bright as to be almost overexposed and the object itself gets so little space in the frame as to be incidental to the photo.  I  like the expression on the face, those super arched eyebrows are a keeper, but the focus here is very poor.  I can''t see anything in focus at all.  Lighting is rough across the board with some nasty highlights around the eyes near the nose.  Glasses were a good choice (if a choice) and are of a nice book-wormish quality.', '2007-11-25 10:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267957, 614804, 61818, '<td valign="top">I think this barely meets the challenge.  Including the glasses at least gives some nod to someone actually increasing their ''book smarts'' by having been looking at the material at some point, but that''s about it.  The shot itself is nicely composed but the lighting is very drab.</td>', 'I think this barely meets the challenge.  Including the glasses at least gives some nod to someone actually increasing their ''book smarts'' by having been looking at the material at some point, but that''s about it.  The shot itself is nicely composed but the lighting is very drab.', '2007-11-25 10:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267959, 613464, 61818, '<td valign="top">Two things could improve this.  First, correct the whitebalance so the hideous yellow cast of the indoor lighting would go away.  Second, how about shooting this from an angle that doesn''t leave me with the impression that the photographer simply walked up behind this girl and took a snapshot?  Seeing her face would be nice, or really any other angle that gave me a more intimate view of the person studying.  I feel like someone passing through the hallway and glancing into a dorm room.</td>', 'Two things could improve this.  First, correct the whitebalance so the hideous yellow cast of the indoor lighting would go away.  Second, how about shooting this from an angle that doesn''t leave me with the impression that the photographer simply walked up behind this girl and took a snapshot?  Seeing her face would be nice, or really any other angle that gave me a more intimate view of the person studying.  I feel like someone passing through the hallway and glancing into a dorm room.', '2007-11-25 10:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267960, 614617, 61818, '<td valign="top">Maybe the original comic had the guy bent over like that.  Not sure it''s working for you here.  Think if the other pant leg were as pulled up you''d have captured the smart nerd thing better.  Shot really needs a contrast increase.</td>', 'Maybe the original comic had the guy bent over like that.  Not sure it''s working for you here.  Think if the other pant leg were as pulled up you''d have captured the smart nerd thing better.  Shot really needs a contrast increase.', '2007-11-25 10:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267962, 615091, 61818, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the composition, but the lighting is very nice and it was a good choice doing this in black and white.</td>', 'Don''t care for the composition, but the lighting is very nice and it was a good choice doing this in black and white.', '2007-11-25 10:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267964, 615159, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the photo itself really needs work.    Pulling the subject away from the wall (and probably figuring out some other way to keep that stack of books on her head) would get rid of the shadows.  Also the focus here is off.  Smaller aperture, get everything from the cover of the book she is reading back to her face in focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the photo itself really needs work.    Pulling the subject away from the wall (and probably figuring out some other way to keep that stack of books on her head) would get rid of the shadows.  Also the focus here is off.  Smaller aperture, get everything from the cover of the book she is reading back to her face in focus.', '2007-11-25 10:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267966, 615273, 61818, '<td valign="top">Cell phone shot?  You caught a unique perspective, but the image quality is so poor it''s impossible to get past.</td>', 'Cell phone shot?  You caught a unique perspective, but the image quality is so poor it''s impossible to get past.', '2007-11-25 10:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267968, 615177, 61818, '<td valign="top">Why the narrow crop?  I like the concept (and expected to see more like this).  Maybe if there were a guy either in bed or on the way to the bed in the frame the ''cramming'' concept would have more impact.  Overall nice shot.</td>', 'Why the narrow crop?  I like the concept (and expected to see more like this).  Maybe if there were a guy either in bed or on the way to the bed in the frame the ''cramming'' concept would have more impact.  Overall nice shot.', '2007-11-25 10:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267970, 613566, 61818, '<td valign="top">If the dog were actually doing something other than laying there (like doing math problems for instance) then I could buy the fact that he was getting ''book smart''s from his studies.  But without something like that, this shot falls short of the challenge and the humor doesn''t quite have the impact it could.</td>', 'If the dog were actually doing something other than laying there (like doing math problems for instance) then I could buy the fact that he was getting ''book smart''s from his studies.  But without something like that, this shot falls short of the challenge and the humor doesn''t quite have the impact it could.', '2007-11-25 10:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267974, 614982, 61818, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is too harsh leaving the left third of the photo swimming in black.</td>', 'The lighting here is too harsh leaving the left third of the photo swimming in black.', '2007-11-25 10:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267975, 615205, 61818, '<td valign="top">If this is some clever connection to the challenge (like the plant is named bookicus smarticus or something) I''ve completely missed it.</td>', 'If this is some clever connection to the challenge (like the plant is named bookicus smarticus or something) I''ve completely missed it.', '2007-11-25 10:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267978, 614580, 61818, '<td valign="top">Again not seeing the connection to the challenge.  Also the photo suffers from very poor focus.</td>', 'Again not seeing the connection to the challenge.  Also the photo suffers from very poor focus.', '2007-11-25 10:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267979, 615126, 61818, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried to be pretty open minded to what constitutes an example of ''book smarts'', but a library doesn''t show book smarts any more than a shoe store shows me athletic ability.</td>', 'I''ve tried to be pretty open minded to what constitutes an example of ''book smarts'', but a library doesn''t show book smarts any more than a shoe store shows me athletic ability.', '2007-11-25 10:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267981, 614102, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused.  Otherwise a pretty boring shot.  There''s just nothing here to get excited about.</td>', 'Nicely focused.  Otherwise a pretty boring shot.  There''s just nothing here to get excited about.', '2007-11-25 10:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267982, 613888, 61818, '<td valign="top">This isn''t book smarts, it''s mischievousness that happens to involve books.  But I applaud the attempt at humor.  Focus could be a bit better, looks like maybe you got some motion blur from shooting under dim house lighting.</td>', 'This isn''t book smarts, it''s mischievousness that happens to involve books.  But I applaud the attempt at humor.  Focus could be a bit better, looks like maybe you got some motion blur from shooting under dim house lighting.', '2007-11-25 10:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267983, 614496, 61818, '<td valign="top">Could use a bit more contrast in my mind, but this is nicely done.  Like the lighting.</td>', 'Could use a bit more contrast in my mind, but this is nicely done.  Like the lighting.', '2007-11-25 10:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267985, 615148, 61818, '<td valign="top">Honestly he''s getting dumber by the page just by reading stuff like this.  Nice shot, well composed and lit.  The glasses falling down the noise are a good touch.</td>', 'Honestly he''s getting dumber by the page just by reading stuff like this.  Nice shot, well composed and lit.  The glasses falling down the noise are a good touch.', '2007-11-25 10:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267988, 615197, 61818, '<td valign="top">The thick black border is a crime here.  I can barely make out what is going on in the shot because it was taken from 17 miles away, and then part of the frame is lopped off amd replaced with two thick black lines.  Lighting looks nice.</td>', 'The thick black border is a crime here.  I can barely make out what is going on in the shot because it was taken from 17 miles away, and then part of the frame is lopped off amd replaced with two thick black lines.  Lighting looks nice.', '2007-11-25 10:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4267995, 615094, 61818, '<td valign="top">Given the rest of garbage in this challenge, I suppose this is a top ten shot.  It doesn''t convey book smarts in the least, but I''m betting that won''t hold it back.</td>', 'Given the rest of garbage in this challenge, I suppose this is a top ten shot.  It doesn''t convey book smarts in the least, but I''m betting that won''t hold it back.', '2007-11-25 11:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
