(4268479, 615186, 86892, '<td valign="top">This is genius.  I''m a little sad about all the paper that was ruined to make this shot, but the composition and thought behind this makes it worth it.<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'This is genius.  I''m a little sad about all the paper that was ruined to make this shot, but the composition and thought behind this makes it worth it. Well done!', '2007-11-25 19:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
