(4268596, 614580, 84438, '<td valign="top">A nice soft look to this photograph for sure, but could have used a slight rotation I think.  I also think would have been more pleasing to the eye without the photograph.</td>', 'A nice soft look to this photograph for sure, but could have used a slight rotation I think.  I also think would have been more pleasing to the eye without the photograph.', '2007-11-25 21:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
