(4272303, 615177, 84410, '<td valign="top"><i>11/25/2007 10:42:05 AM<br/>Why the narrow crop? I like the concept (and expected to see more like this). Maybe if there were a guy either in bed or on the way to the bed in the frame the ''cramming'' concept would have more impact. Overall nice shot.</i> <br/> <br/>my pillow cases only reach out that far and i didnt want there to be any colour in the backround but the colour of the satin.<br/> <br/>also, if there were a guy in the picture it would have been an entirely different picture.</td>', '11/25/2007 10:42:05 AMWhy the narrow crop? I like the concept (and expected to see more like this). Maybe if there were a guy either in bed or on the way to the bed in the frame the ''cramming'' concept would have more impact. Overall nice shot.  my pillow cases only reach out that far and i didnt want there to be any colour in the backround but the colour of the satin. also, if there were a guy in the picture it would have been an entirely different picture.', '2007-11-28 00:05:04.000000', NULL, 0),
