(4272593, 615186, 57229, '<td valign="top">I hate it too (when newcomers win ribbons without ''paying their dues''). Actually, I don''t, but even if I did there''s a glimmer of justice in the world because this is far and away the best entry in the challenge and the ribbon is properly merited.<br/>Congratulations and thanks for entering.</td>', 'I hate it too (when newcomers win ribbons without ''paying their dues''). Actually, I don''t, but even if I did there''s a glimmer of justice in the world because this is far and away the best entry in the challenge and the ribbon is properly merited.Congratulations and thanks for entering.', '2007-11-28 01:29:35.000000', NULL, 0),
