(4273124, 615205, 23484, '<td valign="top">You know, this is just my cynical take on this shot. In all reality, it was probably a stretch to meet the challenge however it was done very well. The detail was extraordinary.<br/> <br/>However, had this been a shot of a fabulous sunset, the northern lights, Cannon Beach, or something similar that was just as equally if not more removed from the challenge, the voting population would have gone ga-ga over it and the very same people that DNMC''d you would have given you high scores!<br/> <br/>You only have to meet the challenge if your image is not a cliche shot!<br/> <br/>Just my CYNICAL take on things.</td>', 'You know, this is just my cynical take on this shot. In all reality, it was probably a stretch to meet the challenge however it was done very well. The detail was extraordinary. However, had this been a shot of a fabulous sunset, the northern lights, Cannon Beach, or something similar that was just as equally if not more removed from the challenge, the voting population would have gone ga-ga over it and the very same people that DNMC''d you would have given you high scores! You only have to meet the challenge if your image is not a cliche shot! Just my CYNICAL take on things.', '2007-11-28 08:17:20.000000', NULL, 0),
