(4312383, 615197, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s light enough for me and I love the juxtaposition.  It''s well and subtly done.  Excellent perspective for this.</td>', 'It''s light enough for me and I love the juxtaposition.  It''s well and subtly done.  Excellent perspective for this.', '2007-12-13 06:55:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4327454, 615274, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  A very cute idea!  What you ought to try (if you can get the dog to try again) is focus on the glasses - the lenses if possible.  The title of the book will still be large enough to read but it will give it a neat perspective and have more of the dog in focus.  Still a very amusing photograph!</td>', 'LOL!  A very cute idea!  What you ought to try (if you can get the dog to try again) is focus on the glasses - the lenses if possible.  The title of the book will still be large enough to read but it will give it a neat perspective and have more of the dog in focus.  Still a very amusing photograph!', '2007-12-21 05:23:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372059, 614859, 61651, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully understated take on the challenge - perfect perspective and b&amp;w was a good choice.</td>', 'A wonderfully understated take on the challenge - perfect perspective and b&w was a good choice.', '2008-01-07 22:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
