(4656969, 615105, 53147, '<td valign="top">I actually voted this high. Thought it was a well done image. But it looks like you were disqualified because you didnt provide an original - not because of the effect. And from reading the comments that were left you did achieve a good handful of kudos. If you had ribboned and not been dqed the backscratching would have come out in droves as well. Thats just the way DPC is. Top 3 get most of the views after voting is over, and thus they get most of the comments. 29 comments and 2 faves is nothing to sneeze at.</td>', 'I actually voted this high. Thought it was a well done image. But it looks like you were disqualified because you didnt provide an original - not because of the effect. And from reading the comments that were left you did achieve a good handful of kudos. If you had ribboned and not been dqed the backscratching would have come out in droves as well. Thats just the way DPC is. Top 3 get most of the views after voting is over, and thus they get most of the comments. 29 comments and 2 faves is nothing to sneeze at.', '2008-04-24 08:58:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4714681, 614731, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is so sweet, and gave this a good score. Ir definitely suits the challenge, and she is such a sweetie. I an at a loss to why the voters did not score this higher, as you did not deserve the low scores that you got for this one. My only thought is that there must have been a strong % of higher scores in this challenge.</td>', 'This is so sweet, and gave this a good score. Ir definitely suits the challenge, and she is such a sweetie. I an at a loss to why the voters did not score this higher, as you did not deserve the low scores that you got for this one. My only thought is that there must have been a strong % of higher scores in this challenge.', '2008-05-21 10:53:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4819417, 615094, 96227, '<td valign="top">great job....my only constructive comment would be to have your model lower the book, so you get a sharper shot of the facial expression</td>', 'great job....my only constructive comment would be to have your model lower the book, so you get a sharper shot of the facial expression', '2008-07-11 15:38:40.000000', NULL, 0);
